.TH POWER 1 "August 2026" "power" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
power \- manage CPU power profiles and GPU modes on Zephyrus
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B power
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ args ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B power
is a thin wrapper around
.BR powerprofilesctl (1)
and
.BR supergfxctl (1)
for the Zephyrus laptop.
It groups commands into CPU and GPU subgroups and provides a combined
.B status
view.
With no arguments,
.B power
behaves as
.BR "power status" .
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BR status
Show the current CPU profile, GPU mode, AC state and battery status.
.TP
.BR battery
Show battery charge and charging status.
.SS GPU subgroup: g, gpu, gpu-mode
.TP
.BR "g hybrid"
Switch the dGPU to Hybrid mode (the default on AC).
.TP
.BR "g integrated"
Switch the dGPU to Integrated mode (the default on battery).
.TP
.BR "g get"
Show the current dGPU mode.
.SS CPU subgroup: c, cpu, cpu-profile
.TP
.BR "c save"
Switch to the power-saver profile.
.TP
.BR "c balanced"
Switch to the balanced profile.
.TP
.BR "c perf"
Switch to the performance profile.
.TP
.BR "c get"
Show the current power profile.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help ", " help
Print usage information and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
power                  # combined status
power g get            # current GPU mode
power g hybrid         # enable the dGPU
power c perf           # maximum performance
power c save           # battery saving
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /sys/class/power_supply/BAT0
Battery status source.
.TP
.I /sys/class/power_supply/AC0
AC state source.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR powerprofilesctl (1),
.BR supergfxctl (1)
.SH AUTHOR
bjorn
